  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.13 - System.Text.Json Migration and Exchange Expansion\n- Complete migration from Newtonsoft.Json to System.Text.Json\n- New JsonExtensions class with safe parsing methods (GetStringSafe, GetDecimalSafe, etc.)\n- Fixed GetStringSafe method overload ambiguity for Object types\n- 5 New FULL exchanges: BinanceUs, Bitget (v2 API), Huobi, Korbit, Kucoin\n- Total 14 FULL exchanges (was 9), 0 PARTIAL (was 3), 96 SKELETON\n- Test coverage expanded from 90 to 452 tests (8.79% line coverage)\n- Fixed Authorization header accumulation bug in HttpClientService",
